  "description": "Jung Hyunwoo is just an unlucky gamer barely making ends meet in the VR game \"God Wars.\" He even ends up losing access to his game account due to a horrible accident and is forced to create a new character. In the process, he discovers that he has an ability that allows him to see hidden information in the game, which leads him to become a Grand Warlock. Now equipped with a mind-blowing skill and a legendary class, all that's left is for him to level up and go from zero to hero... \n\n(Source: Tapas)",
